From: J P <jpwatters@mac.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:14:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 15/37] web: 10-burst test button on the FT8 page

One click sets CQ 'Stop after' = 10 calls and no listening slot, switches
the Tab5 to FT8 if needed, starts the CQ run, counts the bursts from
/api/status and restores both settings when the run ends (ten sent,
answered, cancelled, or stopped with the same button). The previous values
are kept in localStorage so a reload mid-run still restores them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W7MAsxUnuCnfwkHxdqp61S
